# Assignable

"role.raven.name" : "Raven"
"role.raven.short" : "Ra"
"role.raven.blurb" : "The Killer Of The Dream"

# Document

"document.tip.winCond.raven.title" : "Kill Trigger"
"document.tip.winCond.raven" : "The Raven wins by killing all enemies."

"role.raven.doc" : "A neutral who can leave the meeting to kill the target."
"role.raven.winCond" : "All enemies are killed."
"role.raven.ability.title" : "Inherent Ability [Demon In Dream]"
"role.raven.ability.main" : "You can temporarily leave the meeting and enter a dream, where everything is identical to reality.<br>You will be assigned a target role in the dream. Kill surviving players by killing players of the corresponding role. %RAVENHUNT%"
"role.raven.ability.leave" : "<title>Leave/Return</title>Leave the meeting and enter the dream.<br>If you are already in the dream, you will return to the meeting."
"role.raven.ability.kill" : "Try to kill the target player.<br>Return to the meeting and cannot leave again during this meeting if the role of the target is not the target role.<br>When there are no Impostors alived, you can kill other players during the task phase."
"role.raven.ability.ravenHunt" : "<br>When only <var>%NUM%</var> players are alive, <b>"Raven Hunt"</b> will begin.<br>During this time, you cannot kill the Raven, report or use vents.<br>It lasts <var>%DURATION%</var>s. If anyone still survives when the hunt is over, you will suicide."
"role.raven.tips" : "・The role is created by <b>DHMO</b>."

